-- Ways of delivering a skill (piercing line, ring round the caster, lane and field that stay, burst on the spot): the book skills of every element and six path skills get new areas and looks. The stored rows (INSERT OR IGNORE never refreshes them) are replaced only while they still hold the earlier defaults (kim_3 a burst on the spot, Cuong Tram 6 tiles long, no look for kim_3); a missing row is left to the code defaults. No admin screen edits these two groups yet.
